cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If local-leaf helped you write a paper or thesis, you can cite it like this."
title: "local-leaf: an offline Overleaf-style LaTeX editor for macOS"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aneesh
    family-names: Iyer
repository-code: "https://github.com/aneesh-iyer29/local-leaf"
url: "https://local-leaf.aneeshiyer.com/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  local-leaf is a browser-based LaTeX editor in the spirit of Overleaf that runs locally on macOS
  and compiles with the user's own TeX distribution through latexmk, with SyncTeX, Overleaf
  import, per-project Git, an integrated terminal, and a command-line interface for AI coding
  agents.
keywords:
  - LaTeX
  - Overleaf alternative
  - LaTeX editor
  - SyncTeX
  - macOS
  - AI agents
